{"version":1,"content":"<p>《第63屆金馬獎》今晚（22日）於台北流行音樂中心舉行，大會得日本紅星福士蒼汰擔任頒獎嘉賓，除頒發「最佳新人獎」之外，當他頒發「最佳動作設計時」時卻示範動作，但卻不慎整個人撻低做滾地葫蘆，但他反應敏捷避過尷尬。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:03:49.569074+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:26:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:57:13.880270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:57:13.880270+00:00","content_hash":"cf2f0d877f4fb207efd4b5a8ad1fdf91cd4818d161022ac6fbcc9923d8044098","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}